##

00:00:01.566 --> 00:00:03.032 line:85%
<i>(laughs)</i>

00:00:03.032 --> 00:00:05.386 line:91%
<c.yellow>So basically,
Tom texts me and says,</c>

00:00:05.386 --> 00:00:07.063 line:91%
<c.yellow>"Do you want to do
something with hovercrafts?</c>

00:00:07.063 --> 00:00:09.083 line:91%
