on this date and this time."</c>

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:11.779 line:91%
<c.yellow>And here we are. I've arrived.
We don't know what we're doing.</c>

00:00:11.779 --> 00:00:13.603 line:91%
No, neither of us know
what we're doing.

00:00:13.603 --> 00:00:16.272 line:91%
All I know is that the crew
told us both to report

00:00:16.272 --> 00:00:20.078 line:91%
