00:00:20.078 --> 00:00:22.487 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, you'd call it Midlands.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:27.557 position:56% line:91%
And there's gonna be some sort of
hovercraft race, or battle, or duel.

00:00:28.314 --> 00:00:29.814 line:85%
You have done the Hoverbike.

00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:31.704 line:91%
You got two paramotors,
pointed 'em downwards,

00:00:31.704 --> 00:00:34.197 line:91%
and floated on top of it!
<c.yellow>I know! That seemed...</c>

00:00:34.197 --> 00:00:37.888 line:91%
<c.yellow>This probably should have been
