00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:43.193 position:70% line:91%
<c.yellow>Exactly. Exactly that.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yes. Just less likely to  take your legs off.</c>

00:00:43.193 --> 00:00:45.476 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's a mattress motorbike.</c>

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.422 line:85%
<c.yellow>It's like an air bed. That  goes.</c>

00:00:48.422 --> 00:00:50.276 line:91%
You're not wrong.
You're not wrong at all!

00:00:50.774 --> 00:00:53.309 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>And then it looks like
we're going to destroy a golf course.</c>

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:54.360 line:91%
Yep.
<c.yellow>So...</c>

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.631 line:85%
Yeah, it'll be fine.

00:01:00.001 --> 00:01:01.658 line:85%
<c.cyan>Plan for today:</c>

00:01:01.658 --> 00:01:03.640 position:61% line:85%
<c.cyan>You're gonna have a bit of a challenge.</c>

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.801 line:85%
