00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.169 line:85%
<c.cyan>You need a bit of practice,</c>

00:01:06.169 --> 00:01:08.137 line:91%
<c.cyan>'cause we're gonna do
a bit of hovercrafting,</c>

00:01:08.137 --> 00:01:10.833 line:85%
<c.cyan>archery, and axe throwing.</c>

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:12.091 line:91%
<i>(laughs)</i>
<c.cyan>Okay?</c>

00:01:12.091 --> 00:01:13.981 line:91%
Okay! <i>(laughs)</i>
<c.cyan>Bit different.</c>

00:01:13.981 --> 00:01:17.615 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>Well, I never thought you'd be saying
