00:01:17.615 --> 00:01:20.000 line:91%
Right, okay!
<c.cyan>But it's all part and parcel.</c>

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.106 line:85%
<c.cyan>So, it's gonna be a timed session.</c>

00:01:22.106 --> 00:01:23.785 position:59% line:85%
