<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(Tom and Mark laugh)</i></c>

00:01:30.743 --> 00:01:32.183 line:85%
<c.yellow>Get in your hovercraft!</c>

00:01:32.183 --> 00:01:34.656 line:91%
