<c.yellow>Okay. </c><c.colorEEEEEE> Alright.</c>

00:01:35.851 --> 00:01:37.536 line:91%
<c.cyan>You're gonna stop,
get out of the hovercraft,</c>

00:01:37.536 --> 00:01:39.383 line:91%
<c.cyan>do the activity, jump back in,
