00:01:46.878 --> 00:01:48.018 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>
<c.cyan>Okay?</c>

00:01:48.018 --> 00:01:50.526 line:91%
<c.yellow>So ideally, we want...
a quick time.</c>

00:01:50.526 --> 00:01:52.958 line:91%
<c.cyan>You want a quick time,
but you want maximum points.</c>

00:01:52.958 --> 00:01:55.567 position:64% line:91%
<c.yellow>Okay.</c>
<c.cyan>And then that brings all your times down.</c>

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:58.361 line:91%
I've got a prediction here.
