00:02:02.216 --> 00:02:04.135 line:91%
<c.yellow>Whoa-whoa-whoa,
we don't know that yet!</c>

00:02:04.135 --> 00:02:07.500 line:91%
And I think I'm just gonna be:
<i>(stammers)</i>

00:02:07.856 --> 00:02:09.624 line:91%
<c.cyan>Right, okay guys.</c>
<c.yellow>Yeah?</c>

00:02:09.624 --> 00:02:12.366 line:91%
<c.cyan>Quick safety talk, so you know
what to do, and what not to do.</c>

00:02:13.078 --> 00:02:14.794 line:91%
I'm gonna guess,
flipping the hovercraft.

00:02:14.794 --> 00:02:16.770 position:69% line:91%
<c.yellow>Flipping the hovercraft... is a 'not', yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Is a 'not'. Okay.</c>

00:02:17.553 --> 00:02:21.144 line:68%
<c.cyan>For you guys, I'm gonna get you
to stay up on your knees.</c>

00:02:21.909 --> 00:02:23.990 line:91%
<c.cyan>Because you can move
your body weight around easier.</c>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:26.427 line:91%
<c.cyan>Now, you've got a kill switch.
Remember, it's like a jet ski.</c>

00:02:26.427 --> 00:02:29.500 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, lanyard.</c>
<c.cyan>Yeah, that's your very...</c>

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.328 line:85%
<c.cyan>Your last point of call, let's say.</c>

00:02:31.328 --> 00:02:33.391 line:91%
<c.cyan>So if you're going
somewhere you don't like,</c>

00:02:33.391 --> 00:02:35.296 line:91%
<c.cyan>if you think something's wrong,
pull that off.</c>

00:02:35.296 --> 00:02:37.772 line:91%
<c.cyan>But if you do pull it off,
make sure you're still holding on.</c>

00:02:37.772 --> 00:02:40.723 line:91%
<c.yellow>Do they slide, obviously?</c>
<c.cyan>They will slide, but—</c>

00:02:40.723 --> 00:02:43.824 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>If they're going forwards, they'll slide.
If you're going sideways, they'll dig.</c>

00:02:43.824 --> 00:02:46.648 line:91%
<c.cyan>You've got your rudders here.
Left and right.</c>

00:02:46.648 --> 00:02:49.117 line:91%
<c.cyan>Push them with your fingers.
Very light, one finger.</c>

00:02:49.117 --> 00:02:51.713 position:69% line:91%
<c.cyan>So it's not like a go-kart.
You don't need to whack it into the corners.</c>

00:02:51.713 --> 00:02:53.203 line:85%
<c.cyan>So it's nice and smooth.</c>

00:02:53.203 --> 00:02:55.812 position:59% line:91%
<c.cyan>If you want to go to the left,
your handlebar comes back towards you.</c>

00:02:55.812 --> 00:02:57.378 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>Your weight goes onto your left knee.</c>

00:02:57.378 --> 00:03:00.001 line:91%
<c.cyan>If you need to, get your right knee
