00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:07.726 position:63% line:85%
<c.cyan>So you can accelerate around the corner.</c>

00:03:07.726 --> 00:03:08.715 line:91%
<c.yellow>Right.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Okay.</c>

00:03:08.715 --> 00:03:11.500 position:63% line:91%
<c.cyan>If you accelerate before the corner,
you'll end up going straight through it.</c>

00:03:12.247 --> 00:03:15.514 position:67% line:91%
