00:03:18.650 --> 00:03:20.421 line:85%
<c.cyan>And then, you've got a throttle.</c>

00:03:20.421 --> 00:03:23.727 position:72% line:91%
<c.cyan>The more you squeeze that, the quicker you go.
Less you squeeze it, the slower you go.</c>

00:03:23.727 --> 00:03:26.342 line:91%
<c.cyan>Okay. I'll get a helmet on
and we'll give you a demo,</c>

00:03:26.342 --> 00:03:28.447 position:58% line:85%
<c.cyan>so you can see how easy it is to fly.</c>

00:03:28.447 --> 00:03:30.662 line:85%
<c.yellow>I like how you use the word 'fly'.</c>

00:03:30.662 --> 00:03:32.229 position:58% line:85%
I like how you use the word 'easy'(!)

00:03:32.229 --> 00:03:34.091 position:58% line:91%
<c.yellow>You're technically not on the ground,
'cause you're hovering.</c>

00:03:34.091 --> 00:03:36.719 line:91%
