00:03:51.946 --> 00:03:54.446 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (rock guitar)</i></c>

00:03:52.759 --> 00:03:54.135 line:85%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(motor turns on)</i></c>

